---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Junseok Bae, MD, PhD | Endoscopic & Deformity Spine Surgery">

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 space-y-16">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
        Junspine.com
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-white leading-tight">
        Endoscopic & Deformity Spine Surgery <br />
        by <span class="text-emerald-400">Junseok Bae, MD, PhD</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl">
        Spine surgeon specializing in endoscopic spine surgery, cervical disc arthroplasty,
        thoracic endoscopy, and adult spinal deformity (ASD). This site showcases research,
        publications, and global education in minimally invasive and motion-preserving spine surgery.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/research" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:bg-emerald-400 transition">
          Research
        </a>
        <a href="/lectures" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-slate-600 text-sm font-medium text-slate-100 hover:border-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition">
          Lectures
        </a>
        <a href="#hospital-contact" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-slate-700 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-400 transition">
          Clinical care (Hospital)
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">
        Affiliation: <span class="text-slate-200 font-medium">Cheongdam Wooridul Spine Hospital, Seoul, Korea</span>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Expertise -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Expertise</h2>

      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-3xl">
        Combining endoscopic techniques with deformity principles to provide motion-preserving,
        minimally invasive solutions for complex spine conditions.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300">Endoscopic Spine Surgery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Endoscopic lumbar discectomy (PELD, UBE), foraminal decompression, and thoracic
            endoscopic discectomy using navigation and advanced visualization.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300">Cervical Disc Arthroplasty</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Motion-preserving cervical disc replacement with careful patient selection and
            long-term follow-up for adjacent segment protection.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300">Adult Spinal Deformity (ASD)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Management of degenerative scoliosis and sagittal imbalance, integrating minimally
            invasive techniques with deformity correction strategies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-700/70 bg-slate-900/40 p-5 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300">Navigation & Immersive Visualization</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Navigation-assisted endoscopy and AR/VR head-mounted displays for immersive surgical
            planning and reduced attention shift in the operating room.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Featured Research -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">Featured Research & Projects</h2>

      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-3xl">
        Selected work highlighting economics, outcomes, and technology in endoscopic and deformity spine surgery.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4">

        <div class="border border-slate-700/70 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 p-4">
          <h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100">
            Global Consensus: Economics of Endoscopic Spine Surgery
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            International consensus analyzing 1.2M cases to understand cost-effectiveness,
            adoption barriers, and global expansion of ESS.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-700/70 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 p-4">
          <h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100">
            Thoracic Endoscopic Discectomy (Springer Textbook)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Detailed chapter on Transforaminal endoscopic thoracic discectomy (TETD),
            technique, indications, and complication avoidance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-700/70 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 p-4">
          <h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100">
            Recurrence Prediction Model (XGBoost · SHAP · SMOTE)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            ML model using pre-op variables to estimate recurrence risk and support shared decision-making.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-700/70 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/40 p-4">
          <h3 class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100">
            Degenerative spine disease Risk Ontology
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Immersive 3D planning and AI-driven disease ontology integrating visualization and prediction.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- Memberships -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-white">
        Global Society Involvement
      </h2>

      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-3xl">
        Active member and faculty in international spine societies.
      </p>

      <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-slate-200">
        <li class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/60">
          Scoliosis Research Society (SRS)
        </li>
        <li class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/60">
          KOMISS
        </li>
        <li class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/60">
          KOSESS
        </li>
        <li class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/60">
          SMISS Asia-Pacific
        </li>
        <li class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-900/60">
          ISSLS
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>


    <!-- Hospital Contact -->
    <section id="hospital-contact" class="space-y-4 border-t border-slate-800 pt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
        Clinical care & appointments
      </h2>

      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-3xl">
        This website is for academic and educational purposes only.
        All medical care, diagnosis, and surgical treatment are provided exclusively through:
      </p>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/60 bg-slate-900/50 p-5 space-y-1">
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-300">
          Cheongdam Wooridul Spine Hospital – International Clinic
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-200">Seoul, Korea</p>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
          📞 +82-2-513-8452<br />
          🌐 <a href="https://www.wooridul.com" class="underline hover:text-emerald-300">
            www.wooridul.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

